    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/e84c59828447e3029d1fe3044e0ef9bb.poster.avif?t=1744737096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/e84c59828447e3029d1fe3044e0ef9bb.webm?t=1744737096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/e84c59828447e3029d1fe3044e0ef9bb.mp4?t=1744737096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bust</strong> some tanks in this playful retro arcade-style shooter featuring 24 cute and <strong>buxom</strong> playable characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>STORY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an alternate 1998 where war has been abandoned in favor of simulated war games featuring women athletes from around the world driving replicas of historical tanks! The biggest of these games is called the Tankette Games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce</strong> your way to being champion of the <strong>Tankette Games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/219948b6b3b0e5de6f0929c0bda24947.poster.avif?t=1744737096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/219948b6b3b0e5de6f0929c0bda24947.webm?t=1744737096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/219948b6b3b0e5de6f0929c0bda24947.mp4?t=1744737096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 playable tanks and characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 playable maps! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wacky boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 mission types!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unlockable minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ collectible illustrated pinup cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200+ collectible in-game figurines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable concept art gallery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate character outfits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable censorship options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/2cb5f31c15f9860798ce483b3d3b46d9.poster.avif?t=1744737096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/2cb5f31c15f9860798ce483b3d3b46d9.webm?t=1744737096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153040/extras/2cb5f31c15f9860798ce483b3d3b46d9.mp4?t=1744737096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All purchasable items in the shop use in-game currency that is earned while playing only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NO MICROTRANSACTIONS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NO GENERATIVE AI!</p>",
